     }
    ],
    "content": "The network moved 1.8 million parcels, a rise of 7\npercent on the year before. The new hub in Leipzig\nopened in September and now handles a third of the\neastern volume. Late deliveries fell to 2.1 percent.\n\nThe warehouse team rebuilt the sorting line during\nthe summer. The work took six weeks and was\nplanned around the quiet months, so customers saw\nno delay. The new line reads every label twice and\nsends unclear parcels to a",
    "confidence": 1.0,
    "description": null,
    "id": 4,
    "type": "text"
   },
