    "content": "José Müller joined as head of operations in May.\nStaff who recieve a parcel at the front desk now log\nit at once, which ends the old paper list. The café in\nthe Zürich office reopened after its façade was\nrepaired.\n\nTraining hours per person rose to 21. Most of the\nnew courses cover safe driving and first aid, and\nevery driver now finishes the road safety course in\nthe first month. The training team also measured the\nper-",
